#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:4
msgid "Route this decomposition request to the appropriate delivery lead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:6
msgid "Determine whether this is product feature work or platform/migration work:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:7
msgid ""
"Product features, user-facing enhancements → delegate to `feature-"
"delivery-lead`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:8
msgid ""
"Migrations, refactors, platform changes → delegate to `platform-delivery-"
"lead`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:10
msgid "The delivery lead will:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:11
msgid "Read the parent spec thoroughly"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:12
msgid ""
"Identify natural boundaries for decomposition (by concern, by layer, by "
"user flow, by risk)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:13
msgid "Create child spec files using the project's spec conventions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:14
msgid "Each child spec should:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:15
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Have its own slug (e.g., `{parent}-auth`, `{parent}-api`, `{parent}-ui`)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:16
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Reference the parent via `relations: [{target: {parent-slug}, kind: "
"parent}]`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:17
msgid ""
"Be independently deliverable (can be designed, built, and tested on its "
"own)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:18
msgid "Include its own Goal, Changes, and Acceptance Criteria sections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:19
msgid "Update the parent spec to:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:20
msgid "Add a `## Child Specs` section listing all children"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:21
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Add relations: `[{target: {child-slug}, kind: child}]` for each child"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:22
msgid ""
"Optionally note the recommended delivery order and dependencies between "
"children"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:23
msgid "Keep the parent spec as the initiative/umbrella — do NOT delete it"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:25
msgid "**Decomposition principles:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:26
msgid "Each child should take no more than 1-2 days to deliver"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:27
msgid ""
"Prefer splitting by vertical slice (feature/user flow) over horizontal "
"slice (layer)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:28
msgid "If children have dependencies, note the delivery order"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:29
msgid ""
"If a child is still too large, note that it can be split further with "
"another `/split`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../.opencode/commands/split.md:31
msgid "Spec to decompose: $ARGUMENTS"
msgstr ""

